<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Text Component on ESPHome - Smart Home Made Simple</title><link>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text/</link><description>Recent content in Text Component on ESPHome - Smart Home Made Simple</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><atom:link href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>LVGL Text</title><link>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text/lvgl/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text/lvgl/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>lvgl&lt;/code> text platform creates an editable text component from an LVGL textual widget and requires &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/lvgl/">LVGL&lt;/a> to be configured.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Supported widgets are &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/lvgl/widgets#lvgl-widget-label">&lt;code>label&lt;/code>&lt;/a> and &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/lvgl/widgets#lvgl-widget-textarea">&lt;code>textarea&lt;/code>&lt;/a>. A single text supports only a single widget; in other words, it&amp;rsquo;s not possible to have multiple widgets associated with a single ESPHome text component.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="configuration-variables">
 Configuration variables
 &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore="all" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="copy-link dark-invert" data-anchor="configuration-variables" title="Copy link" src="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/images/link.svg">
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>widget&lt;/strong> (&lt;strong>Required&lt;/strong>): The ID of a &lt;code>textarea&lt;/code> widget configured in LVGL, which will reflect the state of the text component.&lt;/li>
&lt;li>All other variables from &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text#config-text">Text&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;p>Example:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Template Text</title><link>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text/template/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/components/text/template/</guid><description>&lt;p>The &lt;code>template&lt;/code> text platform allows you to create a text with templated values
using &lt;a href="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/automations/templates#config-lambda">lambdas&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="code-block">
 &lt;button class="copy-button" aria-label="Copy code">
 &lt;svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
 role="none"
 width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
 stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"
 stroke-linejoin="round">
 &lt;rect x="9" y="9" width="13" height="13" rx="2" ry="2">&lt;/rect>
 &lt;path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1">&lt;/path>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;span class="copy-feedback">&lt;/span>
 &lt;/button>
 &lt;div class="codeblock-content">&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c"># Example configuration entry&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">text&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>- &lt;span class="nt">platform&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="l">template&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">name&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;Template text&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">optimistic&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">min_length&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">max_length&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">100&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">mode&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="w"> &lt;/span>&lt;span class="l">text&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>

&lt;h2 id="configuration-variables">
 Configuration variables
 &lt;img data-pagefind-ignore="all" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="copy-link dark-invert" data-anchor="configuration-variables" title="Copy link" src="https://bharvey88.github.io/esphome-docs/images/link.svg">
&lt;/h2>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>min_length&lt;/strong> (&lt;em>Optional&lt;/em>, int): The minimum length this text can be. Defaults to &lt;code>0&lt;/code>.&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>